# Claude Code working directory (local agent state, do not commit)
.claude/

# macOS / iCloud cloud-sync duplicate artifacts. These are exact-byte
# copies of legit files where the OS resolved a sync conflict by
# appending " 2", " 3", etc. before the extension. Pattern is
# distinctive (space before digit) and does NOT match any legit
# project file (project convention uses underscores / hyphens, not
# spaces). Verified 2026-05-27 against the 149 non-cache matches.
* [2-9].py
* [2-9].yml
* [2-9].yaml
* [2-9].json
* [2-9].md
* [2-9].sql
* [2-9].lock